The Newberry NWG 55-29 preset uses reference inputs distributed by BoreTHM.
The source attribution recorded by BoreTHM is:
Newberry EGS Demonstration: Well 55-29 Stimulation Data. Cladouhos, T.T.
(AltaRock Energy). Geothermal Data Repository, submission 271.
https://doi.org/10.15121/1357916. CC BY 4.0.
The preset represents model inputs derived from those data.

Built browser packages include React, React DOM, Lucide, Plotly and Three.js.
The build generates THIRD-PARTY-LICENCES.txt in the installed package from
the npm dependencies' licence files. Their licences continue to apply.

BoreTHM is a separate dependency:
O'Callaghan, L. (2026). BoreTHM: models of circulating temperature and
borehole stability for drilling into superhot rock [Computer software].
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23549104
